      "reason": "An explicit aim/objective is stated (to conduct a systematic review and summarize/critically analyze evidence on SARS-CoV-2 risk factors), but the evidence does not show the objective(s) or question(s) are formulated using a relevant question-formulation framework (e.g., structured question)."
